      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense but its kinda confusing. i dont really know what an \"ingress gateway\" or \"asynchronous processing\" even is... can u just explain it like im actually a person and not an engineer? like what's the actual simple step i can take to make sure our community members dont get locked out when we're trying to help them?",
